<title>TURKEY: Bosphorus closed due to fog for second day.</title>
<headline>Bosphorus closed due to fog for second day.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul's narrow Bosphorus strait remained closed to two-way sea traffic due to dense fog for a second day, maritime officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>An official said a total of around 350 vessels were waiting at the two ends of the strait, the southern Marmara and the northern Black Sea.</p>
<p>In view of the persistent fog it was difficult to say when the waterway would be opened, he said.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875</p>
</text>
